And as we've talked about before,

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:32.640
in crypto markets, leverage
functions very differently

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:34.260
than in traditional markets.

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:37.320
In traditional markets, you
can use existing securities.

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:38.550
What we actually ended up seeing,

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:40.080
there were all of these rumors,

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:42.120
all of this speculation
in traditional media

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:43.950
