00:13:57.810 --> 00:14:02.109 position:64%
I may pledge those machines as collateral

00:14:02.109 --> 00:14:03.780
to secure the loan.

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:06.150
So there's this interesting
capital recursive

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:07.800
that starts to happen.

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:10.590
And what also happens is
you have operating expenses.

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:13.110
Your operating expense
is the cost of energy.

00:14:13.110 --> 00:14:15.240 position:66%
And no matter what type of compute you do,

00:14:15.240 --> 00:14:17.850 position:58%
