00:14:17.850 --> 00:14:19.200
Energy and a semiconductor.

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:22.560
And so the challenge is
energy prices are rising.

00:14:22.560 --> 00:14:25.350
A lot of the contracts that
facilities have in place,

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:28.020 position:63%
