00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:07.260 position:56%
We saw this with natural gas, right?

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:08.820
Shell gas, right?

00:15:08.820 --> 00:15:09.660
If it gets too low,

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:11.280
